<ContentLayout title="About TokenCalculator.dev" description="Why TokenCalculator.dev measures LLM tokens locally and labels estimates honestly." heading="About"><p>TokenCalculator.dev is a small developer tool for checking prompt size, input cost, and context fit before calling an LLM API.</p><p>It was built around three rules: content stays on your device, estimates are labeled honestly, and provider pricing links remain visible.</p></ContentLayout>
